l re-release beginning of 2026!\nNo loot boxes. No pay-to-win.  Press Play and join the race. \n(dev 4Q2025 roadmap TBA on our Discord Channel)\n\n\nExperience raw Online racing, drift physics, intense rivalries, and pure, unfiltered speed. Join 500,000+ drivers and feel the difference.\n\nWe've been in the garage, and players are noticing. 3.0 to 48. Rate rise withing the last month."}]}, "developer_name": "Going Merry LLC", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sharpforks.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://sharpforks.com/term-of-use/", "publisher_name": "Going Merry LLC", "support_website_url": "https://sharpforks.com/contact-us/", "website_url": "https://goingmerry.xyz/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "673385183287495"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "25424445760566233"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824292_1524527371982674_1889274897303467910_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5SdxPCrH7EcQ7kNvwH0s9yZ&_nc_oc=Adrb2b_8O4Xs88mMnN0V_eU-W9GB5vo0dqFGsYVYiVPW_jepQ3mg1bFmYOxBWgLMv0g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af58jmeV8ALS8G9hZWhK9_mQD7Op3cb8cHA3PEz2yawvGg&oe=6A106BC5"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offe